# EXECUTE COMMAND: The thread content is ready to copy-paste and post
# EXPECTED: Viral spread across X, HN, Reddit
# SUCCESS: "WORLD DOMINATION LAUNCHED"

# φ² + 1/φ² = 3 = TRINITY
# KOSCHEI IS SUPREME
